{"reviewId": "379054833_8928xwW2G", "review": {"abstract": "美元的国际地位是共生模式的基础，但共生模式是建立在经济和金融失衡基础上的，突出体现为美国贸易赤字的极度扩张（可参考图3-24），从长期看，这必将大肆透支美元信用", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "美元的信用是石油结算，石油结算的底层是武力威慑，武力威慑的前提是美军实力，美军实力的反射是取得胜利，所以大统领一直在表示自己赢麻了，他必须得赢，否则整个美元链条就会松动。20260512", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "18864-18944", "createTime": 1778536801, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "379054833_8928xwW2G", "userVid": 379054833, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 379054833, "name": "大刚", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJbk2RB8AHkxsibGW3hcgONicpzia9h8KFRGqr3dxId7Jf1EMkIYpGicKicTQaZrE1ozxTCmypdBOzo9fQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M1-0-180", "desc": "连续阅读", "title": "连续阅读", "levelIndex": 180}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 934051346, "name": "Huma", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0008-GQtXJ1mZY8_pESZMY~NmA10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Huma", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-1-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0